resources.string:
Hahacam records camera video and microphone audio — and, in “Screen + me” mode, your screen and the sound of other apps — after you tap “Start recording”, even when you switch to another app or lock the screen. While recording, a notification with a “Stop” button is shown in the notification shade.

Videos are stored only on your phone and are never sent anywhere.

By agreeing, you confirm that you understand:
• other people may accidentally appear in the frame — don't film them without consent;
• screen recordings may contain other people's content and personal data (messages, notifications) — check before sharing;
• recording continues in the background and with the screen locked until you stop it;
• you are responsible for your recordings and how you use them.
